Bestiary: {
	ManicSlime: A frenzied slime pulsing with divine energy. Its erratic glow shifts between heavenly gold and celestial blue as it bounces through the underground Rapture.
	ZealotGhoul: A zealous ghoul prowling the golden deserts of the Rapture. Its fervent devotion has twisted its mind, leaving it in a perpetual state of divine madness.
	BrightMummy: Wrapped in radiant golden bindings, this mummy shambles through the sanctified deserts of the Rapture. Its luminous wrappings confuse any who dare strike it.
	GoldenPigron: A gilded pig-dragon hybrid found lurking in the frozen depths of the Rapture. Its radiant golden scales shimmer as it phases through walls in pursuit of prey.
	ManicBat: A frenzied bat suffused with divine light. It darts through the underground Rapture at blinding speed, leaving a shimmering trail of gold and blue in its wake.
	ArmedMinaret: A crystalline tendril rooted deep within the walls of the underground Rapture. Its gilded segments sway menacingly as it launches radiant sword beams at any who wander too close.
	Cherub: A small winged guardian of the Rapture, darting through the golden skies with reckless abandon.
	Seraph: Majestic winged serpents that patrol the radiant skies of the Rapture, striking down trespassers with divine fury.
	Acolyte: A diminutive but zealous warrior of the Rapture, hurling blessed hammers at any who would defile its sacred grounds.
	BlessedSword: A sentient blade imbued with divine energy, floating silently through the underground Rapture in search of the unworthy.
}

