Dialogue: {
	GuideRaptureHint: I keep dreaming about the deepest reaches of our world. Something down there feels ominously calm. I'd investigate, but I've grown fond of it here.
	GuideHallowHint: I keep dreaming about some outlandish things in the deepest reaches of our world. I'd investigate, but I've grown fond of it here.
}
